<title>POLAND: Forte Q2 net falls to PLN 0.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Forte Q2 net falls to PLN 0.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forte preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.11   vs    1.96</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 2.14   vs    1.60</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.24   vs    1.59</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Fabryki Mebli Forte SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     71.83   vs   55.49</p>
<p>    costs of sales			59.90   vs   39.67</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.19   vs    0.35 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.90   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.99   vs    1.84</p>
<p>    financial costs			2.16   vs    1.85</p>
<p>    investment			     2.69   vs    1.37</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     6.83   vs    7.37</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 7.66   vs    5.03</p>
<p>    net profit			     4.30   vs    5.02</p>
<p>    net sales			    148.89   vs  120.19</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     106.66   vs   85.62</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.05   vs    0.57 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			     3.36   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   4.21   vs    2.33</p>
<p>    financial costs			3.44   vs    4.10</p>
<p>    investment			     9.50   vs    2.90</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
